  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>Affiliate Commission Policy </strong></p><p><strong>1. Commission Eligibility</strong><br>Commissions are counted for valid orders, which means:</p><ul><li><p>The customer purchases through the affiliate’s link/coupon.</p></li><li><p>The order is successfully paid.</p></li><li><p>The order is not canceled, refunded, or fraudulent.</p></li></ul><p><strong>2. Order Confirmation Period</strong><br>All orders will be held for <strong>30 days</strong> from the purchase date to ensure no cancellations/refunds.<br>After this period, the order will be confirmed as valid and commissionable.</p><p><strong>3. Commission Payout Schedule</strong><br>Commissions are paid on the <strong>10th of each month</strong>.<br>The payout amount is the total confirmed commissions from eligible orders as defined in section (2).</p><p><strong>4. Payment Method</strong><br>Currently, we support commission payments via: <strong>PayPal <br></strong></p><p><strong>5. Minimum Payout Threshold</strong><br>The minimum commission amount required for payout is <strong>$20</strong>.<br>If the threshold is not met, the commission will be carried over to the next cycle.</p><p><strong>6. Support &amp; Contact</strong><br>If you have any questions regarding tracking or payments, please contact us via:</p><ul><li><p>Email: lenamcn@gmail.com</p></li></ul></div>",
